+/**
+ * Pure filament math for the Atomic scene (OR-ATOM-008 S8.1).
+ *
+ * No `three`, no DOM, no `Math.random`, no clock. The scene components consume
+ * these pure functions so the arc-length lookup, the bounded pulse-packet
